@host = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@marketplace.dev",
  "password": "Customer@123",
  "confirmPassword": "Customer@123",
  "firstName": "Aarav",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "phoneNumber": "+9779800000000"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@marketplace.dev",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Products
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20&sort=newest
